    "title": "Gilgit-Baltistan's Electoral Battle 2026: End of Outdated Traditions and the Rising Sun of New Leadership",
    "date": "03-06-2026",
    "paper": "Daily Mashriq News and Daily Yome-e-Takbeer",
    "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dlafcjt6z/image/upload/v1780464290/GB_Election_zamana_news_2026-06-03_brhvth.jpg",
